     what is on the wires, and what our own job has left behind it) is cut away, and the story's own moment
     comes up in its place. The stage stays. */
  .fig svg.ex .wd { transition: opacity 0.26s var(--ease-out); }
  .fig svg.ex.cut .wd { opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.09s var(--ease-io); }
